CarRecorderMax is a WIFI based intelligent cloud full HD driving recorder mobile phone application software, is a new way to connect the driving recorder. With CarRecorderMax, you can connect the car recorder for video preview, playback, pictures and video downloads, and you can also share your favorite pictures to social networks.
Main functions:
1. Live broadcast. After connecting to the driving recorder through CarRecorderMax, the current recording content can be broadcast in real time;
2. Preview playback. Support the preview and playback of the video recorded by the driving recorder through CarRecorderMax;
3. View the content. Support for managing and viewing photos and videos taken by the recorder through CarRecorderMax;
4. One-click sharing. Support to share your favorite photos to social networks;
5. intelligent control. Support various Settings of the recorder through the app;
